{"code":"ar","name":"Arabic","native":"العربية","variant":"Modern Standard","badge":"ع","tts":"ar-SA","rtl":true,"about":"Modern Standard Arabic: read and understood everywhere, though each country speaks its own dialect.","sheets":[{"id":"C1","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Keep it alive","blurb":"The lines that rescue any conversation. You’ll use these every day, everywhere.","items":[{"id":"c1.1","t":"لا أفهم.","say":"lā afham","en":"I don't understand.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.2","t":"لا أعرف.","say":"lā aʿrif","en":"I don't know.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"]},{"id":"c1.3","t":"لحظة من فضلك.","say":"laḥẓa min faḍlak","en":"One moment, please.","ctx":["work","shops","phone"],"tags":"wait hold on sec moment"},{"id":"c1.4","t":"أعد من فضلك.","say":"aʿid min faḍlak","en":"Please say it again.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"repeat again pardon what"},{"id":"c1.5","t":"ببطء من فضلك.","say":"bi-buṭʾ min faḍlak","en":"Slower, please.","ctx":["travel","chat"],"tags":"slow slowly speak"},{"id":"c1.6","t":"كيف تقول «…» بالعربية؟","say":"kayfa taqūl … bil-ʿarabiyya?","en":"How do you say “…” in Arabic?","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"word translate"}]},{"id":"C2","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"React like you belong","blurb":"Short reactions that make you sound fluent while you listen.","items":[{"id":"c2.1","t":"طبعًا.","say":"ṭabʿan","en":"Sure. / Of course.","ctx":["work","shops","chat"],"tags":"yes ok okay sure course"},{"id":"c2.2","t":"بالضبط.","say":"biḍ-ḍabṭ","en":"Exactly. / Right.","ctx":["work","chat"],"tags":"yes right correct agree"},{"id":"c2.3","t":"أظن ذلك.","say":"aẓunnu dhālik","en":"I think so.","ctx":["work","chat"]},{"id":"c2.4","t":"حقًا؟","say":"ḥaqqan?","en":"Really?","ctx":["chat"]},{"id":"c2.5","t":"لا مشكلة.","say":"lā mushkila","en":"No problem. / No worries.","ctx":["work","travel","chat"],"tags":"welcome fine ok"},{"id":"c2.6","t":"رائع!","say":"rāʾiʿ!","en":"Great! / How nice!","ctx":["chat","family"],"tags":"cool awesome nice"},{"id":"x.C21","t":"إن شاء الله.","say":"in shāʾ allāh","en":"Hopefully. / God willing. (said about any future plan)"}]},{"id":"C3","mode":"utility","kind":"core","title":"Frames","blurb":"Phrases with a blank. Drop in any word you know and you have a new sentence.","items":[{"id":"c3.1","t":"أين {x}؟","say":"ayna {x}?","en":"Where is {x}?","ctx":["travel","toilets"],"tags":"where find","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bathroom","fits":["place","work"]},{"id":"c3.2","t":"أريد {x}.","say":"urīdu {x}","en":"I want {x}.","ctx":["food","shops"],"tags":"want like would order get","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"coffee","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.3","t":"هل عندكم {x}؟","say":"hal ʿindakum {x}?","en":"Do you have {x}?","ctx":["shops","food"],"tags":"have any got there","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"water","fits":["thing"]},{"id":"c3.4","t":"{x} من فضلك.","say":"{x} min faḍlak","en":"{x}, please.","ctx":["everywhere"],"tags":"please give","frame":true,"takes":"noun","ex":"bill","fits":["thing","work"]},{"id":"c3.5","t":"يجب أن أذهب.","say":"yajibu an adhhab","en":"I have to go.","ctx":["work","plans"],"tags":"must need got"},{"id":"c3.6","t":"هل يمكنني الدخول؟","say":"hal yumkinunī ad-dukhūl?","en":"Can I come in?","ctx":["work","travel"],"tags":"can may could allowed"}]},{"id":"W","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"work","title":"Work: Slack & meetings","blurb":"Mostly lines you already know, plus two new ones and some words for your blanks.","items":[{"id":"w.1","t":"سأتحقق من ذلك.","say":"sa-ataḥaqqaq min dhālik","en":"I'll check it.","tags":"look into get back"},{"id":"w.2","t":"عندي اجتماع.","say":"ʿindī ijtimāʿ","en":"I have a meeting.","tags":"busy call"}],"core":["c1.3","c1.1","c1.2","c1.4","c2.1","c2.2"],"words":["meeting","file","screen","message","tomorrow"]},{"id":"T1","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Eating out","blurb":"Your frames do most of the ordering. A few new lines and some food words.","diet":true,"items":[{"id":"t1.1","t":"هل هو حار؟","say":"hal huwa ḥārr?","en":"Is it spicy?","tags":"hot chili"},{"id":"t1.2","t":"بدون بصل من فضلك.","say":"bidūn baṣal min faḍlak","en":"Without onion, please."},{"id":"t1.3","t":"بماذا تنصحني؟","say":"bi-mādhā tanṣaḥunī?","en":"What do you recommend?"},{"id":"t1.4","t":"لا آكل اللحم.","say":"lā ākulu al-laḥm","en":"I don't eat meat.","tags":"vegetarian vegan meat"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.4","c3.3","c1.1"],"words":["water","coffee","bill","menu","beer","this"]},{"id":"T2","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Shopping & money","blurb":"Want, have, one moment: all core. Four new lines.","items":[{"id":"t2.1","t":"بكم هذا؟","say":"bikam hādhā?","en":"How much is it?","tags":"price cost how much"},{"id":"t2.2","t":"أتفرج فقط.","say":"atafarraju faqaṭ","en":"I'm just looking."},{"id":"t2.3","t":"سآخذه.","say":"sa-ākhudhuh","en":"I'll take it."},{"id":"t2.4","t":"هل يمكنني الدفع بالبطاقة؟","say":"hal yumkinunī ad-dafʿ bil-biṭāqa?","en":"Can I pay by card?","tags":"credit card cash pay"}],"core":["c3.2","c3.3","c1.3"],"words":["this","bag"]},{"id":"T3","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Getting around","blurb":"Ask with your core frame, then understand the answer.","items":[{"id":"t3.1","t":"هل هو بعيد؟","say":"hal huwa baʿīd?","en":"Is it far?"},{"id":"t3.2","t":"إلى المطار من فضلك.","say":"ilā al-maṭār min faḍlak","en":"To the airport, please. (taxi)","tags":"taxi cab driver"},{"id":"t3.3","t":"يسار · يمين · إلى الأمام","say":"yasār · yamīn · ilā al-amām","en":"left · right · straight on","hear":true,"tags":"directions"}],"core":["c3.1","c1.5","c1.4"],"words":["station","airport","hotel"]},{"id":"T4","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"travel","title":"Travel: Toilets, help & signs","blurb":"Ask with your core frame. New: a few emergency lines and the signs you’ll see.","signs":true,"items":[{"id":"t4.1","t":"ساعدوني!","say":"sāʿidūnī!","en":"Help!","tags":"emergency"},{"id":"t4.2","t":"لا يوجد ورق تواليت.","say":"lā yūjad waraq tuwālīt","en":"There's no toilet paper."},{"id":"t4.3","t":"أشعر بتعب.","say":"ashʿuru bi-taʿab","en":"I feel unwell.","tags":"ill unwell doctor"},{"id":"t4.4","t":"اتصل بالإسعاف من فضلك.","say":"ittaṣil bil-isʿāf min faḍlak","en":"Please call an ambulance.","tags":"emergency doctor"}],"core":["c3.1","c3.4","c1.1"],"words":["bathroom","pharmacy","hospital"]},{"id":"F","mode":"utility","kind":"lens","lens":"family","title":"Family & small talk","blurb":"Reactions carry the conversation. Four new lines to start one.","items":[{"id":"f.1","t":"تشرفنا.","say":"tasharrafnā","en":"Nice to meet you."},{"id":"f.2","t":"من أين أنت؟","say":"min ayna anta?","en":"Where are you from?"},{"id":"f.3","t":"ماذا تعمل؟","say":"mādhā taʿmal?","en":"What do you do (for work)?"},{"id":"f.4","t":"لذيذ جدًا!","say":"ladhīdh jiddan!","en":"It's delicious!"}],"core":["c2.1","c2.4","c2.6","c2.3"]},{"id":"B1","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Hello & basics","blurb":"Greetings, yes and no, please and thanks.","items":[{"id":"b1.1","t":"مرحبًا.","say":"marḥaban","en":"Hello.","tags":"hi hey"},{"id":"b1.2","t":"صباح الخير.","say":"ṣabāḥ al-khayr","en":"Good morning."},{"id":"b1.3","t":"كيف حالك؟","say":"kayfa ḥāluk?","en":"How are you?"},{"id":"b1.4","t":"نعم. · لا.","say":"naʿam · lā","en":"Yes. · No."},{"id":"b1.5","t":"من فضلك.","say":"min faḍlak","en":"Please."},{"id":"b1.6","t":"شكرًا.","say":"shukran","en":"Thank you."},{"id":"b1.7","t":"آسف.","say":"āsif","en":"Sorry. / Excuse me.","tags":"excuse me pardon apologize"},{"id":"b1.8","t":"مع السلامة.","say":"maʿa as-salāma","en":"Goodbye.","tags":"bye"}]},{"id":"B2","mode":"basic","kind":"basic","title":"Numbers","blurb":"Enough for prices, times and phone numbers.","items":[{"id":"b2.1","t":"واحد · اثنان · ثلاثة","say":"wāḥid · ithnān · thalātha","en":"1 · 2 · 3"},{"id":"b2.2","t":"أربعة · خمسة · ستة","say":"arbaʿa · khamsa · sitta","en":"4 · 5 · 6"},{"id":"b2.3","t":"سبعة · ثمانية · تسعة","say":"sabʿa · thamāniya · tisʿa","en":"7 · 8 · 9"},{"id":"b2.4","t":"عشرة · عشرون · مئة","say":"ʿashara · ʿishrūn · miʾa","en":"10 · 20 · 100"},{"id":"x.B21","t":"١ ٢ ٣ ٤ ٥ ٦ ٧ ٨ ٩ ١٠","say":"wāḥid … ʿashara","en":"Arabic digits 1–10: you’ll see them on prices and signs"}]},{"id":"B3","mode":"basic","kind":"blueprint","title":"Blueprint","blurb":"How the language works, on one page. Spot the pattern; skip the rulebook.","items":[{"id":"b3.1","t":"التفاحة حمراء.","say":"at-tuffāḥa ḥamrāʾ","en":"The apple is red.","note":"no “is” · the adjective agrees (feminine) · read right to left"},{"id":"b3.2","t":"آكل التفاحة.","say":"ākulu at-tuffāḥa","en":"I eat the apple.","note":"the a- prefix means “I”"},{"id":"b3.3","t":"أكلت التفاحة.","say":"akaltu at-tuffāḥa","en":"I ate the apple.","note":"past uses an ending: -tu = I"},{"id":"b3.4","t":"أريد أن آكل التفاحة.","say":"urīdu an ākula at-tuffāḥa","en":"I want to eat the apple.","note":"want + an + verb"},{"id":"b3.5","t":"هل تأكل التفاح؟","say":"hal taʾkulu at-tuffāḥ?","en":"Do you eat apples?","note":"هل (hal) at the start asks yes/no"}]}],"words":[{"id":"bathroom","t":"الحمام","say":"al-ḥammām","en":"the bathroom","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"toilet restroom washroom wc loo"},{"id":"pharmacy","t":"الصيدلية","say":"aṣ-ṣaydaliyya","en":"the pharmacy","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"drugstore chemist medicine"},{"id":"hospital","t":"المستشفى","say":"al-mustashfā","en":"the hospital","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"doctor emergency"},{"id":"station","t":"المحطة","say":"al-maḥaṭṭa","en":"the station","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"train metro subway"},{"id":"airport","t":"المطار","say":"al-maṭār","en":"the airport","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"flight plane"},{"id":"hotel","t":"الفندق","say":"al-funduq","en":"the hotel","kind":"noun","cat":"place","tags":"room stay"},{"id":"water","t":"ماء","say":"māʾ","en":"water","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink"},{"id":"coffee","t":"قهوة","say":"qahwa","en":"a coffee","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"cafe drink"},{"id":"bill","t":"الحساب","say":"al-ḥisāb","en":"the bill","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"check pay receipt"},{"id":"menu","t":"قائمة الطعام","say":"qāʾimat aṭ-ṭaʿām","en":"the menu","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"food order"},{"id":"beer","t":"بيرة","say":"bīra","en":"a beer","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"drink alcohol"},{"id":"this","t":"هذا","say":"hādhā","en":"this one","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"that one"},{"id":"bag","t":"كيس","say":"kīs","en":"a bag","kind":"noun","cat":"thing","tags":"plastic bag"},{"id":"meeting","t":"الاجتماع","say":"al-ijtimāʿ","en":"the meeting","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"call standup zoom"},{"id":"file","t":"الملف","say":"al-milaff","en":"the file","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"document doc"},{"id":"screen","t":"الشاشة","say":"ash-shāsha","en":"the screen","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"share screen"},{"id":"message","t":"الرسالة","say":"ar-risāla","en":"the message","kind":"noun","cat":"work","tags":"slack text dm"},{"id":"tomorrow","t":"غدًا","say":"ghadan","en":"tomorrow","kind":"time"}],"diet":{"title":"حساسية · من فضلك اقرأ","ask":"هل يحتوي هذا الطبق على أي من هذه المكونات؟","askEn":"Does this dish contain any of these?","thanks":"شكرًا جزيلًا!","note":"Written in Modern Standard Arabic so it reads anywhere. Peanut is also called سوداني (sudani).","options":{"peanut":{"label":"Peanut allergy","t":"عندي حساسية شديدة من الفول السوداني. لا أستطيع أكل الفول السوداني أو زيته.","en":"I have a severe peanut allergy. I can't eat peanuts or peanut oil."},"shellfish":{"label":"Shellfish allergy","t":"عندي حساسية شديدة من المأكولات البحرية (الروبيان، السلطعون، المحار).","en":"I have a severe shellfish allergy (shrimp, crab, shellfish)."},"gluten":{"label":"No gluten","t":"لا أستطيع أكل الغلوتين (القمح، الشعير، الجاودار).","en":"I can't eat gluten (wheat)."},"vegetarian":{"label":"No meat or fish","t":"أنا نباتي. لا آكل اللحم ولا الدجاج ولا السمك.","en":"I don't eat meat, chicken or fish."},"pork":{"label":"No pork","t":"لا آكل لحم الخنزير.","en":"I don't eat pork."}}},"signs":[{"t":"دورة المياه · حمّام","en":"Restrooms"},{"t":"رجال · نساء","en":"Men · Women"},{"t":"خروج · دخول","en":"Exit · Entrance"},{"t":"ادفع · اسحب","en":"Push · Pull"},{"t":"مخرج طوارئ","en":"Emergency exit"}]}